    <ns0:title>v0.9.5: Qwen3.5/3.6, Gemma 4, Transformers v5</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Added primary support for Qwen3.5/Qwen3.6/Gemma4 models and compatibility with Transformers v5.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[misc] set dev version by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/hiyouga/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/hiyouga"&gt;@hiyouga&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a</ns0:content>
