    <ns0:title>v0.9.4: Goodbye 2025</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;Farewell to 2025. Thank you to all contributors and supporters. We will continue to deliver an easy and efficient LLM fine-tuning framework to the community in 2026. Stay tuned.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Breaking&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repository name updated: LLaMA-Factory → &lt;strong&gt;LlamaFactory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python 3.9–3.10 have been deprecated; LlamaFactory now requires &lt;strong&gt;Python 3.11–3.13&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li</ns0:content>
